{"name": "War of Banners", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\"Start with a handful of soldiers, and rise to become a warlord who shakes the battlefield!\"</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">War of Banners is a sandbox, turn-based tactical RPG set in a realistic medieval open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely explore an era of chaos where war and intrigue never cease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit mercenaries, command your army to win brutal battles, expand your influence, and conquer new territories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether leading a wandering mercenary band, serving as a loyal knight, ruling as a benevolent lord, or reigning as an empire\u2014your strategies and choices will alter the course of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a true medieval battlefield in War of Banners, blending the realistic weight of warfare with deep tactical simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a Vast Medieval World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roam freely across a vast continent and encounter diverse factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to intervene or remain neutral in the wars between marauders, holy orders, merchant guilds, and kingdoms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/f64bdd49235f39fd0940dcc8fcddf833.poster.avif?t=1783926048\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/f64bdd49235f39fd0940dcc8fcddf833.webm?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/f64bdd49235f39fd0940dcc8fcddf833.mp4?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>High-Freedom Mercenary Progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire, train, and equip your mercenaries to prepare for the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your soldiers will grow and rank up, but they may also die or betray you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/7e1eea2bec041e685ccf53fe760b5273.poster.avif?t=1783926048\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/7e1eea2bec041e685ccf53fe760b5273.webm?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/7e1eea2bec041e685ccf53fe760b5273.mp4?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Turn-Based Tactical Unit Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dominate the battlefield by utilizing terrain and formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every turn, your choices determine victory or defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Overwhelm your enemies using strategic advantages such as flank attacks, high ground dominance, and encirclement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/1ae8ff44da550461ca5d248860e04fa4.poster.avif?t=1783926048\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/1ae8ff44da550461ca5d248860e04fa4.webm?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/1ae8ff44da550461ca5d248860e04fa4.mp4?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fief Conquest &amp; Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop conquered fiefs and expand your influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct buildings and manage resources to grow your fief with your own strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to bolster your defenses or maximize production.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/c900f237c086b071411af8ee6c00bb8b.poster.avif?t=1783926048\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/c900f237c086b071411af8ee6c00bb8b.webm?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/c900f237c086b071411af8ee6c00bb8b.mp4?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Politics &amp; Faction Expansion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer cities, levy taxes, forge alliances, or declare war on other lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Even a single player can reshape the balance of power in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/8357b19f5a60227326c4e69089bbdf5d.poster.avif?t=1783926048\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/8357b19f5a60227326c4e69089bbdf5d.webm?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/extras/8357b19f5a60227326c4e69089bbdf5d.mp4?t=1783926048\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "War of Banners is a sandbox turn-based tactical RPG set in a medieval open world. Recruit companions, lead your army, and claim victory across brutal battlefields. From a wandering mercenary band to an empire-ruling sovereign \u2014 your fate is shaped by strategy and choice.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3869940/a89e41cb9c6f28c8418a9cce0cfe8e1c99b41cc0/header.jpg?t=1783926048", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Open World", "Medieval", "Turn-Based Combat", "Tactical"], "developers": "Jackto Studios", "publishers": "Jackto Studios", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3869940", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "2 September 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/hPMt1PSga0o", "first_seen": 1756764000.0, "review_rank": 1500}